<h2><a name="6"></a><div class="storyTitle">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;We weren't kidding.  <!-- <a href="?cat=1" title="category: General"><span class="storyCategory">[General]</span></a>-->

<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;
<span class="storyAuthor">rejekted 

<!-- c&#111;n&#110;&#101;c&#116;&#98;&#114;&#105;an&#64;ya&#104;o&#111;.&#99;&#111;m</span>
 @ <a href="index.php?m=200209#6">07:43:27</a>
-->
 - Thursday, September 26, 2002 
</div>
</h2>
<div class="storyContent">
For the first time on Fennin Ro, the Ring of Vulak has been defeated by Night of Vengeance. Nice work stickin it out, even though I fell asleep. Loot was: headband, gloves, shoulders, an earring, ancient avatar and ancient burnout. <br /><br /><img src="http://www.chasalow.com/novguild/vulakdead2.jpg" border="0" alt="vulakdead">

</div>

