<h2><a name="4"></a><div class="storyTitle">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Vulak`Aerr says, "Get out of NToV, NoV!"  <!-- <a href="?cat=1" title="category: General"><span class="storyCategory">[General]</span></a>-->

<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;
<span class="storyAuthor">rejekted 

<!-- c&#111;nnec&#116;b&#114;ia&#110;&#64;&#121;&#97;&#104;&#111;o&#46;co&#109;</span>
 @ <a href="index.php?m=200209#4">01:44:10</a>
-->
 - Monday, September 23, 2002 
</div>
</h2>
<div class="storyContent">
Vulak was spawned tonight by NoV for the first time on fennin ro since his departure. Unfortunately, we got overwhelmed just before we could kill him, so expect a "vulak dead" update next time. I must say- everyone was on top of their game this evening, and we learned a lot.<br /><br /><img src="http://www.chasalow.com/novguild/vulak3.jpg" border="0" alt="vulak"><br /><br /><img src="http://www.chasalow.com/novguild/herald.jpg" border="0" alt="herald"> <br />


</div>

<!-- // this is just the end of the motor - don't touch that line either :) -->
	
<h2><a name="2"></a><div class="storyTitle">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Emperor Ssraeshza 0, NoV 1  <!-- <a href="?cat=1" title="category: General"><span class="storyCategory">[General]</span></a>-->

<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;
<span class="storyAuthor">rejekted 

<!-- &#99;o&#110;n&#101;&#99;&#116;bri&#97;n&#64;ya&#104;&#111;&#111;&#46;c&#111;m</span>
 @ <a href="index.php?m=200209#2">04:52:36</a>
-->
 - Tuesday, September 17, 2002 
</div>
</h2>
<div class="storyContent">
<center><b>3</b> days ago, we formed the Night of Vengeance, an Everquest guild on the Fennin Ro server. It was a conscious effort to create a guild that took some of the best players on the server and matched them with some of the most experienced raid leaders on the server. 3 days later, Emperor Ssraeshza was dead. Loot was: the first acrylia handled broadsword on the server (grats phlean!), gebron's demented cloak (ssjaj) azaalil's ring of analogies (zahib) GSS supernuke (ozlynn), and 40 planar rifts.<br />
<br />
<img src="http://www.chasalow.com/novguild/empdead.jpg" border="0" alt="emp" /><br />
<br />
<br /><br />Earlier that day, we also rocked a Cursed, leaving me with my new favorite poker, thanks guys. also quite noteworthy on the cursed corpse were 2 circlets of smoke, for mel and tim.<br /><br /><img src="../khalsh.jpg"><br /><br /> Expect to see more from us soon.<br /><br /><img src="../enter.jpg"><br />
</center><br />


</div>

